  "subject": "Inbound call, Finance",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Gloria Rivera",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Janet Whitcomb",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:44:06-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Finance Department, Janet Whitcomb speaking. Good morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:44:09-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning. Um, my name is Gloria Rivera. I am calling about the property tax. I have a, a paper here, so I read it slowly. Okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:44:17-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine, Ms. Rivera. Take your time. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:44:21-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I live at one sixty-three Bellevue Avenue. I am the renter. The landlord gave me the tax bill to pay my part, so I paid the first installment. I want to confirm that it posted."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:44:32-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right. I can look that up. Can you tell me when you made the payment and how you paid it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:44:39-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] I paid on the twentieth of January. With a check, at City Hall, at the window."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:44:45-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. One moment while I pull up the account for that address. [pause] Yes, I see a payment received on the twentieth of January, applied to the first installment. It shows as posted."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:44:55-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is posted. Good. Thank you. I have one more question on my paper. What are the hours for the assessor's office?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:45:02-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The assessor's office keeps regular City Hall weekday hours, Monday through Friday, during the business day. I'd suggest calling ahead before you come in, in case they're out on a site visit."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:45:12-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Monday to Friday. I ask because my sister-in-law runs a daycare in her living room, and she has questions about her assessment. I will tell her."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:45:20-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I see. She can contact the assessor's office directly with those questions. Would you like me to transfer you there now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:45:27-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, thank you. Not today. I only wanted the hours. That is all I need."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:45:32-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Very well. Is there anything else I can help you with, Ms. Rivera?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:45:36-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. Thank you for your help. Goodbye."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:45:39-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Have a good day."
    }
  ],
